        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>1\" Diameter Chalice Shower Door Knob Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Chalice shaped knobs are stunning in their simplicity. The chic design that is highlighted by any of the 8 available finish colors. The 1\" diameter Chalice Knob features a concave center.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-15-specifications.gif?v=1704354573\" width=\"600\" height=\"180\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Chalice Shower Door Knob Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the The Chalice Shower Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 29/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Glass Hole Diameter: 3/8\" - 1/2\"</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with 2 Chalice knobs and includes all the hardware for back to back mounting (knobs hook to each other) on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors, with either a 3/8\" or 1/2\" diameter hole in the glass.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Knobs - 1 knob for each side of the glass)</b>\r\n</p>",
